"at": 14.35,
"secs": 5.88,
"who": "n",
"text": "Her teacher, the Choir's prima voice, promised the girl that their song would never end."
}
],
"title": null
},
{
"beat": 3,
"at": 20.68,
"secs": 12.03,
"lines": [
{
"file": "film/vo/03_0.mp3",
"at": 21.03,
"secs": 6.6,
"who": "n",
"text": "On the highest island, the monk Kaien had kept the gate of the Sky Shrine alone for nine years,"
},
{
"file": "film/vo/03_1.mp3",
"at": 27.88,
"secs": 4.38,
"who": "n",
"text": "guarding a sacred tree that held the seals of the world."
}
],
"title": null
},
{
"beat": 4,
"at": 32.71,
"secs": 8.92,
"lines": [
{
"file": "film/vo/04_0.mp3",
"at": 33.06,
"secs": 8.12,
"who": "n",
"text": "The shrine's orphan, Kagemaru, was raised beside him by the same master, and passed over for the guardian's seal."
}
],
"title": null
},
{
"beat": 5,
"at": 41.63,
"secs": 14.35,
"lines": [
{
"file": "film/vo/05_0.mp3",
"at": 41.98,
"secs": 8.0,
"who": "n",
"text": "Far below, in the neon rain of Neo-Kurogane, Raijin was the undefeated champion of the underground duels."
},
{
"file": "film/vo/05_1.mp3",
"at": 50.23,
"secs": 5.3,
"who": "n",
"text": "His mother's katana had been struck by lightning on the night of her funeral."
}
],
"title": null
},
{
"beat": 6,
"at": 55.98,
"secs": 13,
"lines": [
{
"file": "film/vo/06_0.mp3",
"at": 56.33,
"secs": 7.28,
"who": "n",
"text": "In Hangar Zero, a mechanic's son named Haruto Daimon swept the floor beneath two unfinished giants."
},
{
"file": "film/vo/06_1.mp3",
"at": 63.86,
"secs": 4.05,
"who": "vorn",
"text": "Never hold back, Haruto. Not in the cockpit. Not in life."
}
],
"title": null
},
{
